/**
 * @page culite_module_index Module Index
 * 
 * Comprehensive guide to the cuLite library modules. Select a subpage below to explore specific components and implementation details.
 *
 * - @subpage culite_module_index_datatypes
 * - @subpage culite_module_index_allocators
 * - @subpage culite_module_index_vectors
 * - @subpage culite_module_index_matrices
 *
 * @defgroup culite_module_index_datatypes Datatypes
 * @brief The basic cuLite datatypes and precision aliases.
 * @details This module defines the fundamental numerical types used across the cuLite ecosystem. It includes 
 * abstractions for signed and unsigned integers (configurable for 32-bit or 64-bit widths) and floating-point 
 * types for real and complex numbers. These types ensure binary compatibility between host C++ code and 
 * NVIDIA CUDA device kernels.
 *
 * @defgroup culite_module_index_allocators Allocators
 * @brief Memory management and allocation strategies for GPU computing.
 * @details Allocators handle the lifecycle of memory on the device. This module provides specialized 
 * routines for standard device allocation, unified memory (managed) access, and pinned host memory 
 * to optimize data transfer throughput between the CPU and GPU.
 * 
 * @defgroup culite_module_index_copying Transfer/Copy Data Between Memory Spaces
 * @brief Utility functions for transferring data between host and device memory.
 * @details This module offers a suite of functions and operators to facilitate efficient copying of
 * data between CPU (host) and GPU (device) memory spaces. It supports synchronous and asynchronous
 * transfers, as well as conversions between different data representations.
 *
 * @addtogroup culite_module_index_vectors Vectors
 * @brief High-performance vector containers for CUDA.
 * @details This module contains vector classes optimized for linear algebra operations on NVIDIA GPUs. 
 * It manages device memory pointers and provides seamless integration with cuBLAS and other NVIDIA libraries.
 * @{
 *   @defgroup culite_module_index_vectors_dense Dense Vectors
 *   @brief Dense vector objects with contiguous device storage.
 *   @details Dense vectors store elements sequentially in GPU memory. They support a variety of 
 *   initialization methods, including random generation and wrapping of existing device pointers.
 * @}
 *
 * @addtogroup culite_module_index_matrices Matrices
 * @brief High-performance matrix containers and structural properties.
 * @details This module provides the framework for matrix computations on the GPU, supporting various 
 * storage formats and mathematical properties such as symmetry and hermiticity.
 * @{
 *   @defgroup culite_module_index_matrices_dense Dense Matrices
 *   @brief Dense matrix objects using column-major device storage.
 *   @details Dense matrices are optimized for throughput-heavy operations. This group includes 
 *   classes for real and complex data, providing interfaces for matrix-matrix and matrix-vector products.
 *   @warning Currently, only matrices with General property are supported. Support for structured
 *   matrix types (Symmetric, Hermitian, etc.) is planned for future releases.
 *
 *   @defgroup culite_module_index_matrices_sparse Sparse Matrices
 *   @brief Sparse matrix objects and compressed storage formats.
 *   @details This module provides support for matrices where most elements are zero. It includes 
 *   Coordinate (COO) format for construction, Compressed Sparse Row (CSR), and Compressed Sparse 
 *   Column (CSC) formats for accelerated sparse-dense arithmetic.
 *   @note Sparse matrix support is currently under active development.
 * @}
 *
 * @addtogroup culite_module_index_cuda_utils CUDA Module Utilities
 * @brief Core CUDA runtime and library utility classes.
 * @details This module encompasses wrapper classes for CUDA runtime components and NVIDIA library
 * handles. It provides convenient RAII-based management of CUDA streams, cuBLAS contexts, and cuSOLVER
 * handles, ensuring proper resource lifecycle and exception safety.
 * @{
 *   @defgroup culite_module_index_stream_utils Stream Utilities
 *   @brief CUDA stream management and synchronization.
 *   @details Provides RAII-based management of CUDA streams that enable asynchronous kernel execution
 *   and memory operations. Streams allow overlapping computation and data transfer for improved GPU
 *   utilization.
 *   
 *   Classes:
 *   - @ref culite::CudaStream : Main class for CUDA stream management
 * 
 *   @defgroup culite_module_index_cublas_utils cuBLAS Utilities
 *   @brief cuBLAS library wrapper and handle management.
 *   @details Encapsulates cuBLAS handle creation and provides convenient methods for Basic Linear
 *   Algebra Subprograms (BLAS) operations on GPU. This module simplifies calling cuBLAS functions
 *   with automatic resource management.
 *   
 *   Classes:
 *   - @ref culite::CuBlasHandler : Main handler class for cuBLAS operations
 *  
 *   @defgroup culite_module_index_cusolver_utils cuSOLVER Utilities
 *   @brief cuSOLVER library wrapper and handle management.
 *   @details Provides wrapper functionality for cuSOLVER handles used in linear algebra computations
 *   such as matrix factorizations, eigenvalue problems, and linear system solving on GPU.
 *   
 *   Classes:
 *   - @ref culite::CuSolverHandler : Main handler class for cuSOLVER operations
 * 
 *   @defgroup culite_module_index_cusparse_utils cuSPARSE Utilities
 *   @brief cuSPARSE library wrapper and handle management.
 *   @details Provides wrapper functionality for cuSPARSE handles used in sparse matrix computations
 *   such as sparse matrix-vector multiplication, sparse matrix-matrix multiplication, and format
 *   conversions on GPU.
 *   
 *   Classes:
 *   - @ref culite::CuSparseHandler : Main handler class for cuSPARSE operations
 * @}
 * 
 * @defgroup culite_module_index_stream_operators Stream Operators
 * @brief Utility operators for asynchronous execution and data flow.
 * @details A collection of operators designed to interact with CUDA streams. These facilitate 
 * non-blocking execution, synchronization, and intuitive data streaming between host and device 
 * using standard-like syntax.
 * 
 * @defgroup culite_module_index_host2device_operators Host to Device Operators
 * @brief Operators for transferring data from host to device memory.
 * @details Provides overloaded operators and utility functions for copying data from CPU memory
 * to GPU memory. These operators support both synchronous and asynchronous transfers using CUDA
 * streams for efficient data movement.
 * 
 * @defgroup culite_module_index_device2host_operators Device to Host Operators
 * @brief Operators for transferring data from device to host memory.
 * @details Provides overloaded operators and utility functions for copying data from GPU memory
 * back to CPU memory. These operators enable retrieval of computation results with support for
 * both blocking and non-blocking transfers.
 */
